  "content": "{\"response\": \"## Comprehensive Survey: `utxo-bundle`\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Summary\\n\\n`utxo-bundle` is 
an **Amplifier bundle** that turns an AI assistant into a Bitcoin node operator. It provides a complete toolkit for 
managing Bitcoin UTXOs via Bitcoin Core RPC, operating a Lightning (LND) node via REST API, and interacting with Aggeus
prediction markets via a local Nostr relay. The bundle is structured as three independently-packaged Python tool 
modules, all wired together through a single `bundle.md` manifest, with a rich context file that instructs the AI how 
to translate natural language into tool calls.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Directory Tree (Source Files Only, Excluding 
`.git`/`.venv`/`__pycache__`)\\n\\n```\\nutxo-bundle/\\n\\u2502\\n\\u251c\\u2500\\u2500 bundle.md                      
