lookup/creation flow\\nend-to-end \\u2014 don't ask the user for market IDs they don't have yet.\\n\\n## Protocol Quick
Reference\\n\\n```\\nMarket creation:  kind 46416 event, signed by oracle privkey\\nShare positions:  kind 46415 
events, linked to market via #e tag\\nShare pricing:    buyer_cost_sats = (100 - confidence_pct) * 
100\\n```\\n\\nExample: 70% confidence maker \\u2192 buyer pays 3,000 sats for a 10,000 sat position.\\n\\n## Workflow:
Browse Markets\\n\\n```\\n1. aggeus_list_markets           \\u2192 get market list with IDs\\n2. aggeus_get_market 
