Call\\n`aggeus_list_markets` first, then extract the ID yourself.\\n\\n## Workflow: Create a Market\\n\\n```\\n1. Parse
question from natural language \\u2192 yes/no format\\n2. Extract resolution_block from \\\"before block N\\\" / \\\"by
block N\\\" phrasing\\n3. Call aggeus_create_market question=<str> resolution_block=<int>\\n4. Return: market_id, 
