`p2sh-segwit` | Wrapped SegWit | `3...` | Compatibility with older software |\\n   199\\t| `legacy` | P2PKH | `1...` | 
Compatibility with very old software |\\n   200\\t\\n   201\\tPrefer `bech32` unless the user specifies otherwise.\\n  
202\\t\\n   203\\t---\\n   204\\t\\n   205\\t## Safety Notes\\n   206\\t\\n   207\\t- `mine_blocks` only works on 
regtest and signet -- never mainnet\\n   208\\t- Always confirm which wallet is active before sending funds or 
splitting\\n   209\\t- After any transaction that moves funds, remind the user it needs confirmation\\n   210\\t\\n   
211\\t---\\n   212\\t\\n   213\\t## Output Contract\\n   214\\t\\n   215\\tFor every operation, always return:\\n   
