        "content": "---\nmeta:\n  name: wallet-manager\n  description: |\n    Bitcoin Core wallet manager for local 
regtest/signet development. Use\n    PROACTIVELY for any request involving wallet setup, funding via mining,\n    UTXO 
inspection, splitting, consolidation, address generation, or\n    sending funds against a local Bitcoin Core node.\n\n 
This agent targets local development environments (Polar, regtest, signet).\n    Mining blocks to fund wallets and 
