\\\"@\\\"\\n    - utxo-bundle:context/aggeus-protocol.md   # \\u2705 Full path from bundle root\\n```\\n\\nSame rules: 
no `@`, use `bundle.name` as namespace, path relative to bundle root.\\n\\n### Q4: How does `bundle.md` include a 
behavior?\\n\\n```yaml\\nincludes:\\n  - bundle: utxo-bundle:behaviors/utxo-bundle   # \\u2705 NO \\\".yaml\\\" 
extension\\n```\\n\\n**Critical gotcha**: The include path does **not** get the `.yaml` extension. From the 
troubleshooting docs: use `my-bundle:behaviors/name`, not `my-bundle:behaviors/name.yaml`.\\n\\n### Q5: `@`-mention 
