git+https://github.com/microsoft/amplifier-foundation@main\n  - bundle: utxo-bundle:behaviors/bitcoin\n  - bundle: 
utxo-bundle:behaviors/lightning\n  - bundle: utxo-bundle:behaviors/aggeus\n```\n\nThe composability payoff is that 
someone could build a bundle that includes *only* `utxo-bundle:behaviors/bitcoin` for a pure L1 workflow, or `bitcoin` 
+ `lightning` without Aggeus. Each behavior is self-contained -- its own tool module, agent, and relevant 
context.\n\nWould you like to commit what we have, or is there anything else you want to tackle first?"
    }
